Subject: [PATCH 08/10] D-51: one body for the fast geodetic height and
 latitude (budget)

geodeticFast and geodeticHeight carried the same one-pass Bowring twice;
they now share heightAt, with the same arithmetic (bit-identical results).
The shared lesson-file chunk, which carries the flight's physics, had grown
to 347.106 kB against its 347 kB ceiling; it is 346.978 kB now. No ceiling
is raised.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018CKDnUSFqs1bpw8C2bZmPj
